Lundberg and Lee [24] introduced SHAP values. Provost [8] and Sheng and Ling [25] established the foundations
for threshold optimization in imbalanced classification. Saito and Rehmsmeier [26] demonstrated that PR-AUC is
more informative than ROC-AUC under severe imbalance.
